      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let yourself be still\"... i don't know. it sounds so peaceful when you put it like that. but everything in my life is so loud and constant. the bills, the expectations, the guilt. it's like there's no way to actually get stillness without just... disappearing from it all.",
